Changes made by Радити (27.11.2026):
- SKILL.md rewritten for the sandbox of Радити: the evaluation loops, subagents,
  the eval viewer and the description optimizer (which run `claude -p`) are
  replaced by a short self-check; packaging hands the skill to the client, who
  saves it with «Сохранить как навык».
- scripts/init_skill.py, scripts/quick_validate.py and scripts/package_skill.py
  are written anew after the scripts of the same names of Anthropic and of
  OpenAI's skill-creator (https://github.com/openai/skills, Apache-2.0).
- The references, agents, assets and eval-viewer folders are not included.
